{"unit_id":"boboozeng__dsh-annotation-plugin#card-zh","repo":"boboozeng/dsh-annotation-plugin","commit":"57c56710bf17fb73d046aa9fb17059f220d06202","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-annotation-plugin 是为 DeepSeek Harness Web 对话提供引用批注的插件。它在助手消息操作区加入引用按钮，并在输入框上方显示可折叠的待处理引用卡片。用户选中文字后可保存为会话注释、查看或取消待处理条目；下一次发送消息时，引用内容会作为上下文加入模型消息。适合希望在追问时带回对话片段的 DSH 用户。需要由 profile 提供 session、agent 和 Web client runtime，无需额外 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:48-73","src/client/AnnotationAction.tsx:53-68","src/index.ts:261-275"]}
{"unit_id":"boboozeng__dsh-annotation-plugin#card-en","repo":"boboozeng/dsh-annotation-plugin","commit":"57c56710bf17fb73d046aa9fb17059f220d06202","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-annotation-plugin adds quote annotations to DSH Web conversations. Select text in an assistant reply to save it in the session, review or remove it in the dock, then include it as context in the next model request. It needs session, agent, and Web client runtime; no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:48-73","src/client/AnnotationAction.tsx:53-68","src/index.ts:261-275"]}
